{"unit_id":"thawline__dsh-memewiki#card-zh","repo":"thawline/dsh-memewiki","commit":"bf3155ad93dedfdbe37798680e79b5386503e38d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 提供本地梗百科，帮助模型识别网络梗、缩写和黑话。它通过模型工具和请求前的系统提示注入，从随插件提供的 SQLite 词库查询词条；还提供梗词条管理设置页。主要功能包括按问梗句式自动预查、精确及别名和前后缀匹配、搜索词条工具、在设置页增删改词条，以及按用户要求向梗维基提交补充反馈。适合希望模型理解中文网络用语并自行维护词库的 DSH 用户。使用本地查询不需额外 API Key；同步词库或提交反馈时需要联网，反馈需先填写联系方式并领取凭证。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:557","lib/index.js:830","lib/index.js:883","lib/client.js:806"]}
{"unit_id":"thawline__dsh-memewiki#card-en","repo":"thawline/dsh-memewiki","commit":"bf3155ad93dedfdbe37798680e79b5386503e38d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memewiki is a DSH Web plugin with a local SQLite meme and slang dictionary. It prefetches matches before replies, provides a search tool, and lets users manage entries in settings. Users may submit approved corrections to the meme wiki. Local lookup needs no API key; syncing requires internet.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:557","lib/index.js:830","lib/index.js:883","lib/client.js:806"]}
