{"unit_id":"thawline__dsh-memewiki#feature-1","repo":"thawline/dsh-memewiki","commit":"bf3155ad93dedfdbe37798680e79b5386503e38d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「自动预查并注入梗词条」：用户消息符合问梗句式或裸词规则时，插件查询本地词库，并把命中的一条词条和接梗提示加入系统提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:883"]}
{"unit_id":"thawline__dsh-memewiki#feature-2","repo":"thawline/dsh-memewiki","commit":"bf3155ad93dedfdbe37798680e79b5386503e38d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「模型主动查梗」：模型调用 search_meme_wiki 并传入梗名、缩写或黑话，插件返回词条用法、标签和解释；未命中时提示词库没有收录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:830"]}
{"unit_id":"thawline__dsh-memewiki#feature-3","repo":"thawline/dsh-memewiki","commit":"bf3155ad93dedfdbe37798680e79b5386503e38d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「维护本地词条」：用户在设置页搜索、分页浏览、创建、编辑或删除词条，可维护标题、标签、别名、用法、出处和摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:415"]}
{"unit_id":"thawline__dsh-memewiki#feature-4","repo":"thawline/dsh-memewiki","commit":"bf3155ad93dedfdbe37798680e79b5386503e38d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「反馈词条修正」：设置页连接梗维基后，用户可授权提交新增内容；插件拉取原文并追加至指定小节，界面显示提交记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:293"]}
{"unit_id":"thawline__dsh-memewiki#feature-5","repo":"thawline/dsh-memewiki","commit":"bf3155ad93dedfdbe37798680e79b5386503e38d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memewiki 的功能「更新本地词库」：用户从设置页手动启动同步；后台运行同步脚本，只补本地尚未收录的词条，并显示运行状态和结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:143"]}
